Cell["\<\
The steps are read off the dependencies, one object each here. Solving the \
first two gives the eight choices of the second point, with no segment yet.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8a41495e-b129-4a2c-86be-7f8aabdbafda"],

